title: "Agentic AI Library: 170 Multi-Agent AI Reference Architectures Across 15 Domains"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Keikha
    given-names: Mahsa
repository-code: "https://github.com/MahsaKeikha/agentic_ai_library"
url: "https://mahsakeikha.github.io/agentic_ai_library/"
abstract: "An open engineering atlas of 170 agentic AI and multi-agent reference systems across 15 domains, accompanied by a production-oriented Gold Standard and readiness framework emphasizing specialized agents, orchestration, deterministic controls, memory governance, evaluation, observability, security, provenance, fail-closed governance, and human authority over consequential actions."
